# What never goes into the image (Dockerfile): real data, the user's links and local folders, builds, caches.
# Of app/data only the simulations (sim_*), without the drawings and documents a user may have put into them.
app/data/*
!app/data/sim_*
app/data/*/.backup
app/data/*/pid.png
app/data/*/pid_plant.json
app/data/*/pid_construct.json
!app/data/sim_blank/pid_construct.json
app/data/*/pid_views
app/data/*/weather_open_meteo.json
app/data/*/documents
app/data/*/silver/documents
app/data_versions
app/.data_version
**/_local
**/_external
# the Site map's heat demand (Hessen and NRW, built files only): in the image, the owner's decision
!app/data/_external/waermeatlas/buildings.sqlite
!app/data/_external/nrw/buildings_*.sqlite
**/_status
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
app/web/dist
docs/_build
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
graphify-out
.git
.github
.claude
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
